    "html": "\n  <div class=\"hero-meta\">\n    <span class=\"level-badge\" data-level=\"3\">Level 3 - Intermediate</span><span class=\"time\">30 min</span>\n    <span class=\"chip warn\">Medium</span><span class=\"chip accent\">Variable window - longest valid</span><span class=\"chip accent\">Sort first</span>\n    <a class=\"chip\" href=\"https://leetcode.com/problems/frequency-of-the-most-frequent-element/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">LC 1838</a>\n  </div>\n  <h1>Frequency of the Most Frequent Element</h1>\n  <p class=\"lead\">Sort, make the window's largest value the target, and keep the window while target × size - sum ≤ k: the values just below the target are always the cheapest to raise. O(n log n) for the sort, O(n) for the window, O(1) extra space.</p>\n"
